{%- comment -%}
  Shared code for every layout. It runs before the layout templates.

  Sections:
    1. Icon sprite      — the wi-* glyphs, inlined once (ADR: never load an icon by URL)
    2. weather_icon     — symbol_code -> glyph, for all 88 MET codes
    3. Poll health      — did each of the two URLs answer?
    4. Warnings         — the most severe warning for the point, and how many more
    5. Now              — the values of the hero
    6. Days             — one record per day, packed into a string, because Liquid
                          cannot append to an array
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} 0. Title bar mark: the plugin icon, without the white tile so it
     sits on the bar. Inlined as base64 rather than loaded by URL, for the same
     reason as the weather glyphs. Source: docs/brand/icon.svg {%- endcomment -%}
